WHY d5d4 WAS NEVER A CANDIDATE:
  rank 4 of the FEN is 'N2P1B1P' -> a4 White Knight, d4 WHITE PAWN, f4 White Bishop, h4 White Pawn.
  d4 is OCCUPIED by a white pawn, so black's d5 pawn is BLOCKED. d5d4 is not a legal move at all.
  python-chess confirms: 'd5d4' in legal moves = False

